  tool: 1
  instructions: "Three rigs show rough-road comfort, brake dive and wheel contact.
    Select a rig. Scrub Inspect Time, then change damping or stiffness. Press Play
    and enable Play on a rig to replay its four-second input. Movement and pitch
    are exaggerated 3\xD7 for visibility."
  challenge: Compare the Measurements field before and after changing damping. The
    Editor workbench adds a fixed standard reference. This is the deterministic half-car
    model. Scene geometry illustrates results and does not drive PhysX.
